Package: projectData.monocle3
Title: 'projectData' Adapter for Disk-Backed 'monocle3' Cell Data Sets
Version: 0.0.0.9002
Authors@R: 
    person("Brad", "Blaser", , "bradley.blaser@osumc.edu", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3168-5423"))
Description: A loader for the 'projectData' adapter framework. It restores
    a saved 'monocle3' cell_data_set whose counts are a 'BPCells' on-disk
    matrix from an installed data package, on first access, without attaching
    'monocle3' or 'projectData' to the search path. Restored matrix files are
    placed in the working directory allocated by 'projectData'.
